plans\">\n    <h2>服务套餐方案</h2>\n    <div class=\"section-desc\">// 严格按需选择，所有套餐均支持多端并发及基础流量保障。</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"grid-2\">\n      \n      <div class=\"ticket-card\">\n        <div class=\"plan-header\">\n          <div class=\"plan-name\">基础版</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-price\">¥15<span>/月</span></div>\n          <div class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</div>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"checklist\">\n          <li>每月 100GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n          <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#faq\" class=\"btn-ticket\">选择基础版</a>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"ticket-card featured\">\n        <div class=\"ticket-badge\">推荐方案</div>\n        <div class=\"plan-header\">\n          <div class=\"plan-name\">旗舰版</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-price\">¥35<span>/月</span></div>\n          <div class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</div>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"checklist\">\n          <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n          <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n          <li>7x24 优先工单支持</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#faq\" class=\"btn-ticket\">选择旗舰版</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"guide\">\n    <h2>使用说明</h2>\n    <div class=\"section-desc\">// 三步配置，快速接入 jmltouzi 网络环境。</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"spec-list\">\n      <div class=\"spec-item\">\n        <h3>01. 确认订阅与凭证</h3>\n        <p>在用户面板中获取您的专属订阅链接或节点配置参数。请妥善保管凭证，切勿泄露给第三方。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"spec-item\">\n        <h3>02. 选择对应客户端</h3>\n        <p>根据您的操作系统（Windows、macOS、Linux、iOS 或 Android）下载并安装兼容的客户端软件。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"spec-item\">\n        <h3>03. 导入并启用连接</h3>\n        <p>将订阅链接导入客户端，更新节点列表，选择适合的区域线路，开启连接即可正常访问。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"faq\">\n    <h2>常见问题</h2>\n    <div class=\"section-desc\">// 关于连接、账户与服务的直接解答。</div>\n    \n    <div class=\"chat-container\">\n      <div class=\"chat-bubble\">\n        <div class=\"role\">USER // 提问</div>\n        <div class=\"content\">jmltouzi 的节点支持哪些主流协议？</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"chat-bubble answer\">\n        <div class=\"role\">JMLTOUZI // 解答</div>\n        <div class=\"content\">我们目前全面支持主流且高效的现代加密传输协议，具体参数可在用户面板的订阅转换页面中查看并按需获取。</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"chat-bubble\">\n        <div class=\"role\">USER // 提问</div>\n        <div class=\"content\">如果流量耗尽，是否可以额外购买叠加包？</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"chat-bubble answer\">\n        <div class=\"role\">JMLTOUZI // 解答</div>\n        <div class=\"content\">当月套餐流量用尽后，您可以通过用户面板随时购买流量叠加包，或者选择升级至更高档次的套餐版本。</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"chat-bubble\">\n        <div class=\"role\">USER // 提问</div>\n        <div class=\"content\">连接时遇到延迟高或断连应该如何排查？</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"chat-bubble answer\">\n        <div class=\"role\">JMLTOUZI // 解答</div>\n        <div class=\"content\">请先尝试更新订阅以获取最新可用节点列表；其次检查本地网络防火墙设置；若问题持续存在，可通过工单系统联系 7x24 技术支持。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n\n<footer>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"footer-content\">\n      <div>© jmltouzi ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.</div>\n      <div>PRAGMATIC NETWORK ACCESS SERVICES.</div>\n      <div><a href=\"#\">BACK TO TOP</a></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>",
